      "unresolved": [
        "Natural scheduling into the typed origin 4170 is not established: the global_u8[356] == 2 test at 4111 is upstream and not measured; what schedules MACHI.MES here is the map's own flow.",
        "What sets global_u8[1470] is not established; the caller (MACHI.MES) itself clears global_u8[1470] at 5916..5922, immediately before the 5927..5943 dispatch, so completion is caller-owned before the callee ever runs (18M I09's shape) -- the callee itself has no done-gate, and a direct reentry replays every message.",
        "The three routine-40 results at EVENTG04.MES:9037 are supplied explicitly in every variant's selections. Native input, option rendering and cadence are omitted under the bounded runtime policy.",
        "Results 1 and 2 move the affection word banked_u16[204] by -2 behind a > 2 gate (offsets 10645 / 12499); result 3 moves it by +2 unconditionally (offset 13567). Both arms of the > 2 gate are witnessed by the word204-2 / word204-3 variants.",
        "The callee writes banked_u16[242] = 36 on every measured row (asserted constant below).",
        "The gap's state_u16[2] loop, the 1224/1301 Christmas-date arms and the global_u8[1389] arms (4230..4920, ahead of the 5927..5943 dispatch) select preludes only; the [1389] arms change the prefix length (16 / 8 messages measured) and are declared as variants of result 1 only.",
        "MACHI.MES past the handoff and native presentation are not measured."
